{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1000_p", "source_sha256": "50e52d4f36ddeabb0d0cd81ec30be634f15bbe700409c007f8620f7b86c76b49", "ja": "（エレナの新しい衣装が届いた。今回は、\nウェディングドレス風の衣装だけど……）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜的新服装送到了。这次是婚纱风格的服装，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "7b0c9b65683b26d847d16951ab472445d1f578142855da75d324e3f89e1d8234", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん♪\nらんらんらららら～♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～♪\n啦啦啦啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2885cb4d3a32988c6c9a13ff12e2bcef7d1dc309e06ad8ce4697318a532b91b1", "ja": "お疲れさま、エレナ。随分機嫌が\n良さそうだけど、その衣装気に入ったのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，艾丽娜。你看起来心情特别好，是喜欢这套服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "50935f0c4e71b6e0a94f94f80ceb8770a317c6fbd26022c1e9257222363d88f3", "ja": "うん！　すっごく気に入ってるヨ～。和風の\nウェディングドレスみたいで、カワイイよネ♪", "zh": "嗯！我超级喜欢的哟～。像日式婚纱一样，特别可爱吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "c5cdfca39a4738ac821fc8e03b392a657898a68d9c0fe74cbcc50c6980a0b9b5", "ja": "この衣装で、ダンスも踊れるんでしょ？\n楽しみだな～、エヘヘ♪", "zh": "穿着这身服装，还能跳舞对吧？\n真期待啊～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1005_p", "source_sha256": "77d6acaacab15b223f3480579899c203b2aee1c5a1cefa414fe3fac3823ef83b", "ja": "ああ、PVの撮影をする予定だからな。\nエレナは、新郎役の男性と踊る事になるけど……。", "zh": "啊，因为预定要拍摄PV。\n艾蕾娜要和饰演新郎的男士跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "ce485bac5d1b291fea40c943b630339e7657558938a639cc4f98c1c0cc0ab951", "ja": "……じーっ。", "zh": "……盯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1007_p", "source_sha256": "90a669abc1ae29c986f77a5e08b4e5d4ad1f286eedafc4d8615c741c32cee950", "ja": "ん？　どうかしたのか、エレナ。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了吗，艾莲娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "0deb1232a22383b90b2659b1c564a6b95b15a2f9cf3b1b30649ea095b7a78573", "ja": "ううん、何でもないヨ。\n{$P$}こそ、どうかしたノ？", "zh": "不，没什么啦。\n{$P$}才是，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "4b8f7f91905dc68a1c973ac2ed6927d6ee42fff7aeef014eb65f26f38575fad6", "ja": "さっきからワタシのコト、じっと見てるけど……\nもしかして、ドレスが変とか？", "zh": "从刚才开始你就一直盯着我看……\n难道说，是我的礼服很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "b7651cf426a95697d25b1162fc11963e8bee25150750b8843b0fc3657be34873", "ja": "ワタシ、何か間違えて着ちゃってる？\nそれとも、衣装が似合ってないとか……？", "zh": "我是不是把什么穿错了？\n还是说，这身服装不适合我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1011_p", "source_sha256": "090bb71986c5371f2912bde7b2d2ff5ecd01ebe3b9280dc98fd03ec17b39e46a", "ja": "あ、ごめん！　エレナのドレス姿、\nすごく綺麗だなと思って見てただけだよ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉！我只是觉得穿着礼服的艾蕾娜特别漂亮，一不小心看入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e5267307bb37a654f79b1cd7f1fe88e5af1a17e3608c400a8def2ad659335f35", "ja": "それに、ウェディングドレス衣装のせいなのかな？\nいつもより、凛とした雰囲気があるっていうか……。", "zh": "而且，不知道是不是因为穿着婚纱服装？感觉比平时多了几分凛然的气质……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "a4f2406fc4fbd9d89b92a82c9597325ef46896c789e100a44201cb161286386d", "ja": "{$P$}、それホント！？", "zh": "{$P$}，真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5854930ca0ba7d17e51bc3bf431768af5584d0e956ac1caa95437b38f308961b", "ja": "う、うん。どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "c6fe7e998fa772afa0a43bce6e0b97bd00f6d632c8e521616c50b4b17bd1d26a", "ja": "実はネ……ちょっとだけ、メグミに\nポージングのレッスンをしてもらったんだヨ！", "zh": "其实呢……我稍微让惠\n教了教我摆姿势哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "f1fc3c67a866d574ea87141d4776a9b06ee49a7724036c8bed8b3d83e8706cec", "ja": "ウェディングドレスみたいな衣装は、姿勢がすごく\n大事なんだって。印象が変わっちゃうからって。", "zh": "听说像婚纱一样的服装，姿势特别重要。因为姿势不同，给人的印象也会变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6fedb893be6c06ab0d83eb6e76db78dd5cf0e03bbe0a571993299cac13f81329", "ja": "言われてみれば、立ち姿が綺麗だな。\n他にも、何か教えてもらったのか？", "zh": "这么说来，她站姿真的很好看。\n还有没有学到其他什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "78eb3a50154eb3e289239e53136e8a821e8280a342b0c9b5a992a8e7a19885b2", "ja": "うん！　歩き方も練習中なノ！\nメグミは、『読モ師匠』なんだって♪", "zh": "嗯！走路姿势也在练习中呢！\n惠美还是我的“读者模特师父”哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "c1942a7d66045c8c08193f14a8c6b2d314381e6b968d1a3f49ec2131f3032925", "ja": "背筋伸ばして、膝を曲げすぎないで、視線は前に！\n意識することが、大事って教えてもらったんだヨ。", "zh": "要伸直背部，膝盖不要弯得太厉害，视线要望向前方！她教我说，时刻注意这些才是最重要的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "47f3f3880ba79c2e26f1ab6d26b90d4cb7bf2ea71fab4c6e2b24a1b78da488ea", "ja": "せっかく、こんなにステキな衣装をもらったんだもん。\nちょっとでも、キレイだなって思ってほしくて……。", "zh": "难得拿到了这么棒的服装嘛。\n就是希望你能觉得我哪怕有一点点漂亮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6460ba87791b4cb9a7a0eeb72882209960754341115c90eb397a10188372b60b", "ja": "そうか、立派な心がけだな。そのせいかな？\n今日のエレナは、いつも以上に可愛く見えるよ。", "zh": "这样啊，真是很棒的心意。是因为这个吗？\n今天的艾蕾娜看起来比平时更可爱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "ec7b3f5b9fb66e4c3d03f639f7ffda9ec73593c1860df51228bed046559502b4", "ja": "{$P$}……エヘヘ。\nありがと！　なんか、照れちゃうヨ……。", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿。\n谢谢！总觉得，有点不好意思呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0184_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "5e3c4fc37c49a37abce3814d16c75178d66fd67cec741945dc18dbf63f8a0172", "ja": "この衣装、早くみんなにも見せたいナ……。\nPVの撮影も、がんばるネ♪", "zh": "这身服装，真想快点给大家也看看啊……。\nPV的拍摄，我也会加油的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
